  "details": "I was Copy Migrating a world I made using the companion but it softlocked on me. I deleted the migrated world since it soft locked, but upon restarting my PC the disk drive was gone. It was not in my explorer, and it when I used the manager tool it displayed the drive as \"unknown not initialized\" attempts to initialize the drive did not work \"A device which does not exist was specified\"\nI was able to resolve the problem by physically opening up the computer and swapping the drive's SATA port on the motherboard.\nI should also add that the drive was a Crucial 1TB SSD",
